\chapter{Encryption System Specification}
\label{chap:encryption_spec}

\section{System Overview}

This specification defines a unified encryption architecture integrating
entropy-rooted randomness generation, lattice-secured post-quantum key
structures, homomorphic encrypted-domain computation, and zero-knowledge
verification. The system is designed for quantum-resistant communication,
privacy-preserving computation, and secure distributed authentication.

