\section{Compliance and Standards}

The system aligns with:
\begin{itemize}
    \item NIST Post-Quantum Cryptography guidelines,
    \item FIPS entropy source requirements,
    \item Homomorphic Encryption Standard (HES),
    \item Zero-Knowledge Proof interoperability standards.
\end{itemize}

\section{Conclusion}

This specification defines a unified encryption system integrating
hardware entropy, post-quantum lattice security, encrypted-domain
computation, and zero-knowledge verification. It is suitable for
high-security, distributed, and quantum-capable infrastructures.